title: "mopacc: C ABI for embedding OpenMOPAC"
abstract: >-
  Split rgpot engine for OpenMOPAC libmopac.so. Same shape as nwchemc and
  cpmdc: rgpot dlopens libmopacc.so; this tree is the C ABI.
